		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Find verified work emails for German contacts\n\nFills the **email** column of your Google Sheet with verified work emails from [Treffer](https://treffer.io/api/email-finder/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template), the email finder built for Germany.\n\n### How it works\n1. Reads your contacts and skips rows that already have an email.\n2. Treffer looks up each person at their company and verifies the address at the mail server.\n3. Writes the email and its status (`valid`, `catch_all` or `not_found`) back to the row.\n\nFound emails cost 1 credit. Misses are free.",
				"height": 420,
				"width": 440
			},
			"id": "8d2e4a10-5c3b-4f7a-b1e2-0a1b2c3d4e06",
			"name": "Sticky Note",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [-520, -160]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "### Setup\n1. Create a sheet with the columns `first_name`, `last_name`, `domain`, `company_name`, `email`, `email_status`. Fill domain, company name or both.\n2. Select your Google credential and the sheet in **Get contacts** and **Save result to sheet**.\n3. [Sign up at Treffer](https://treffer.io/accounts/signup/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template), create an API key and add it as a **Treffer API** credential in **Find work email**.\n\nRows that fail, for example without a name, leave the error output and stay empty for the next run.",
				"height": 340,
				"width": 520,
				"color": 5
			},
			"id": "8d2e4a10-5c3b-4f7a-b1e2-0a1b2c3d4e07",
			"name": "Sticky Note1",
